      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etorikoki Esekiel Yerusalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore to lari le tikitam o imiet le yararoto ang, te nkiterunoto o lari te nkolong e tomon o lapa, to lari le tomon oong'uan eidipaki aaibung'a enkanasa, teina olong; netii apa enkaina o Laitoriani shumata nanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Emb 21.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naayau nanu too nduaat Enkai atua enkop e Israel naaitoton ninye nanu te nchumata oldoinyo oodo oleng, netii shumata enye olchetei laaijo enkanasa naipirare nanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.11.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Emb 11.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore peyie aayau ninye ine, ng'ura, etii apa oltung'ani, laa ore empukunoto enye netiu anaa osuyai, neeta te nkaina enye enkopito natemishoreki o entiyani natemishoreki te nkaina enye; neitashe ninye te wueji e kishomi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naajoki nanu ilo tung'ani, “Enkerai e tung'ani ing'ura, too nkonyek inono, nining too nkiyiaa inono, nipik indamunot inono nena pooki naaitodol iyie, amu kitorikuoki ene peyie aatum aitoduaa iyie ninye; imbalakinye nena pooki nidol enkaji e Israel.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kishomi enkalo oloosaen",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
