          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netii apa olgilata sapuk oota kutuk aji enye to lgoriet le kishomi, naa teine apa eisuji ilo asar opejori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore tiatua ilo goriet le kishomi netii enkishomi natii imisai are too nkaloli pokira, naa ninche eyieng'ieki ilasarri oopejori, o lasarri le ngoki, o lasarri le nkitarruorroto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore tioriong ilo goriet tenkalo najing'ieki e kishomi moikuape, netii imisai are, ore te nkae alo eilo goriet eina kishomi netii imisai are. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netii apa imisai are atua, netii imisai ong'uan oriong, te nchoto e ina kishomi, imisai isiet, naa te nchumata enye eyieng'ieki ilasarri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netii sii apa imisai ong'uan oo soito oogueta te nkaraki olasar opejori entemata enkaina nabo, o lpisiai enkadori, naa entemata nabo olpisiai endapasho, naa entemata nabo enkaina enkilepata, laa ninye eiteleikini intokitin pooki naayieng'ishoreki laa teine eteyieng'ieki olasar opejori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilala oololo, naa ore enkadori enye naa endap e nkaina, neenikino atua ninye tiatua. Ore tenchumata e nena misai naa ine eiteleikini nena kiri naaitaini olasar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
