          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina peyie aariku nanu tiauluo aitijing'u atua olodung'oro liatua, naa ing'ura, etii apa ilgilat aare sapuki otii atua olodung'oro liatua, ore obo naa ole nkishomi e moikuape naipirare kopikop, ore enkae neipirare enkalo e kishomi naing'orita moikuape. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naajoki ninye nanu, ore ele gilata oipirare enkalo e kopikop naa enelelo apolosak ooitasheiki enkaji e Nkai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore olgilata oipirare moikuape olgilata loo lapolosak ooing'or olperere lo lasar; naa kulo ninche ilayiok le Sadok, laa ninye openy tiatua ilayiok le Lawi eishoro enyikaki Olaitoriani aaisiyiai ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netem ninye ina dung'oroto, intemat e nkaina iip nabo enkadori, o ntemat iip nabo endapasho, nerisio inkaloli pokira ong'uan; netii olperere dukuya ina aji Enkai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
