        {
          "text": "Ore enkadori o lgoriet naa intemat e nkaina tikitam ore endapasho naa intemat e nkaina tomon aare naa inkedeta tomon naailepaki; netii apa inkitotoneta embata oo ng'apata too nkaloli pooki.",
